&lt;li&gt;Survey link: &lt;a href='${surveyLink}'&gt;${surveyLink}&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support your anonymity when completing the survey, please do not include details that could identify you or others in your responses. The survey includes a feature that identifies language that may be considered strong or reveal your identity and provides an alternate option with the intent of prioritising constructive feedback and your anonymity. You can choose to accept the suggestion or keep your original message.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
Your feedback supports leadership learning and development across the BC Public Service. Thank you again for your time and thoughtful contribution.
